+---
+id: def-qftx-wilson-loop
+kind: definition
+title: Wilson loop on a finite lattice
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 2
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+axiom_base: "ZF + AC_omega, inherited through the finite lattice data supplier."
