+---
+id: ex-qftx-su2-one-plaquette-wilson-average
+kind: example
+title: One-plaquette SU(2) Wilson average
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 4
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+axiom_base: "ZF + AC_omega through the finite lattice datum."
+deps:
+  - def-countable-choice
